      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PF 07.120 Double Barion : Squared Round</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Long, Robert H: Seattle F Design, Jul 95, p1</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Exercise in using GemCad to go from an SRB to a Barion.</text>
